<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22120" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭn-accessus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>unapproached</i>, <i>unapproachable</i>, <i>inaccessible</i> (cf.:
			invius, impervius, devius, avius). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (<b>poet.</b> and
			post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mare scopulis inaccessum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					12, 14, 30, § 52</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">montes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					28, 32, § 144</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">10, 12, 16,
				§ 34</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Flor. 3, 1, 14</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aditus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					3, 516</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lucus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 7, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spelunca radiis solis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 8, 195</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>unattainable</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pindarus imitationi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 5, 17, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">formositas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 4, p. 155</span></i>
			.</div>
